 "segments": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.62,
   "text": "My son's wart hurts and I can't fix it."
  },
  {
   "s": 2.96,
   "e": 5.2,
   "text": "Everything we tried hurt him more."
  },
  {
   "s": 5.92,
   "e": 7.74,
   "text": "A wart on his foot for a year."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.3,
   "e": 10.66,
   "text": "Store acid was too painful for him."
  },
  {
   "s": 11.26,
   "e": 12.86,
   "text": "So the doctor froze it."
  },
  {
   "s": 13.42,
   "e": 14.3,
   "text": "We held him still."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.96,
   "e": 17.4,
   "text": "He screamed and it grew back anyway."
  },
  {
   "s": 18.1,
   "e": 20.02,
   "text": "Turns out I didn't fail him."
  },
  {
   "s": 20.58,
   "e": 21.74,
   "text": "Here's what the freeze missed."
  },
  {
   "s": 22.06,
   "e": 25.56,
   "text": "Freezing, acid and shaving only snap off the top."
  },
  {
   "s": 25.86,
   "e": 27.1,
   "text": "Like picking a dandelion."
  },
  {
   "s": 27.68,
   "e": 29.54,
   "text": "The root stays under the hard skin."
  },
  {
   "s": 29.54,
   "e": 35.3,
   "text": "So it grows back. That's why I switched to root out. It's an oil with four plants in it"
  },
  {
   "s": 35.3,
   "e": 37.74,
   "text": "The lemon opens up that hard skin"
  },
  {
   "s": 37.74,
   "e": 44.48,
   "text": "The tea tree carries it down up to eight times deeper than a regular cream and the pokeweed and white cedar"
  },
  {
   "s": 44.48,
   "e": 51.18,
   "text": "Break the wort down from the root deep doesn't mean harsh. It's a kid's formula ages four and up"
  },
  {
   "s": 51.18,
   "e": 54.04,
   "text": "No blister just a little cool tingle"
  },
  {
   "s": 54.04,
   "e": 56.14,
   "text": "recommended by pediatricians."
  },
  {
   "s": 56.52,
   "e": 58.08,
   "text": "Bedtime takes two minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": 58.7,
   "e": 60.98,
   "text": "First, two light strokes with the file."
  },
  {
   "s": 61.48,
   "e": 62.76,
   "text": "That opens up the hardtop."
  },
  {
   "s": 63.18,
   "e": 66.5,
   "text": "Only the hardtop, never his skin, so it doesn't hurt."
  },
  {
   "s": 67.06,
   "e": 68.74,
   "text": "Next, I brush the oil on."
  },
  {
   "s": 69.28,
   "e": 71.16,
   "text": "Then, a clear dot seals it in,"
  },
  {
   "s": 71.34,
   "e": 72.94,
   "text": "so it keeps soaking all night."
  },
  {
   "s": 73.56,
   "e": 77.5,
   "text": "No cold can, no acid, nobody holds him down."
  },
  {
   "s": 78.1,
   "e": 80.68,
   "text": "My son's five, he hated the freeze."
  },
  {
   "s": 80.68,
   "e": 83.72,
   "text": "This, he just sticks his foot out at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 84.88,
   "e": 85.72,
   "text": "Does it sting?"
  },
  {
   "s": 86.64,
   "e": 88.24,
   "text": "He says it's just a little cool."
  },
  {
   "s": 88.86,
   "e": 90.5,
   "text": "We call it his wart chapstick."
  },
  {
   "s": 94.02,
   "e": 95.52,
   "text": "Two minutes at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 96.22,
   "e": 98.34,
   "text": "No holding him down, no fight."
  },
  {
   "s": 98.54,
   "e": 100.54,
   "text": "Another freeze he cries through,"
  },
  {
   "s": 100.92,
   "e": 102.42,
   "text": "or two minutes at bedtime."
  },
  {
   "s": 103.12,
   "e": 105.4,
   "text": "Tap the link below and check if buy two,"
  },
  {
   "s": 105.66,
   "e": 107.14,
   "text": "get one free is still on."
  },
  {
   "s": 107.14,
   "e": 110.56,
   "text": "and you're covered by our 90-day money-back guarantee."
  }
 ]
